Z||000001||mrfiero||10-09-2001||08:18 PM||||There are a few of us out here.  I am actually north of Denver now (Greeley) attending UNC, but I am not that far away.<P>There is no club out here (not that we haven't tried), so there is no place where Fieros hang out, per se.  <P>I'd like to help out with a club, but my time is tight since I started school up again.  I tried many years ago to form one, but it never got off the ground.  I know DrRodey (on the forum) was attempting something, but I haven't heard anything lately.<P>Anyways.....LMK when you arrive and <B>WELCOME TO COLORADO!!</B>||||reg||1
